                "text": "Democrats are rejecting a straightforward plan to keep the government open.\n\nInstead they are demanding over $1 trillion in new spending on items like free health care for illegal aliens while cutting $50 billion in investments for rural health care.\n\nWashington Democrats would rather prioritize health care for illegal immigrants over access to care for rural Missourians and other Americans across this country.",
