                "retweet_count": 36,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In order to end their government shutdown, Democrats are demanding taxpayer-funded health care for illegal immigrants and a $50 billion cut to rural health care. That is an outrageous attack on American taxpayers and rural communities all across this country - including in my home state of Missouri.\n\nAt the same time, the WH Council of Economic Advisers estimates that there are over 650,000 SNAP recipients in the state of Missouri, 255,000 of which are children, and the longer the Democrats keep the government shut down, the closer these vulnerable Missourians get to losing their SNAP benefits.",
