                "text": "This week, the Ways and Means Committee approved nine bipartisan bills focused on expanding access to health care, strengthening taxpayer rights, ending improper payments to deceased individuals, and promoting fair trade with our allies.\n\nTogether, each of these bills deliver targeted solutions to real problems faced by real Americans.",
