                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Democrats created these Obamacare subsidies, and they CHOSE to make them temporary so they could prioritize tax benefits for their wealthy donors.\n\nRepublicans are focused on solutions to increase access to health care, drive down costs, and rein in the rampant waste and fraud in the Obamacare system.",
