                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For years, Democrats have pushed a one-size-fits-all health care agenda driven by Washington mandates and bureaucracy. The result: rising premiums, limited choices, and working families and small businesses paying the price while big insurers profit.\n\nThe Lower Health Care Premiums for All Americans Act focuses on real solutions to reduce premiums and expand choices and access to care for ALL Americans.",
