                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The bill promotes flexible, more affordable health care for small businesses by expanding Association Health Plans, allowing small businesses and self-employed workers to team up, expand choices, and lower premiums by up to 30 percent. It also protects employer-sponsored insurance and strengthens CHOICE Arrangements, which help employers offer tax-advantaged health benefits to their employees so they can choose the coverage plan that best fits their needs.",
