                "text": "Under the Republican-enacted Working Families Tax Cuts, Missouri will receive over $216 million in funding through the Rural Health Transformation Program.\n\nFamilies in rural communities across our state will now benefit from greatly expanded health care access, better training and retention for health professionals, and new innovations to fight the chronic disease epidemic thanks to this program.",
